## Summary of Findings

I've identified three classes with genuine, self-contained internal code duplication that could benefit from extract-method refactoring:

### **1. PemPrivateKeyParser (HIGHEST QUALITY CANDIDATE)**

**File:** `/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G004_spring_boot/core/spring-boot/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/ssl/pem/PemPrivateKeyParser.java`

